    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-albesco</span></b> , bŭi, 3,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch.
			n.</i>, <i>to become white.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (very rarely), <i><span class="en">Gell. 12,
